                    <chunk name="param_input" index="25">
                      <items count="6">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">The ASCE/SEI CWE prestandard's two-step process (PO 4-1 / AC 5-9): every direction gets an EMPTY twin (empty_NNN on mesh*_empty) — the same domain, mesh settings, inlet and numerics without the buildings, their volume refined in their place — meshed and solved with it, sampled on the vertical through the site centre. The Study Report's ABL self-sustainment verdict then reads the twin (the incident location proper) instead of the building run's approach station. Costs one extra mesh and solve per direction. Off by default.</item>
                        <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">d7c7f1ad-ecff-45d5-8a06-e06d2d07327b</item>
                        <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Empty Domain Check</item>
