                      <items count="7">
                        <item name="Access" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">1</item>
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">The terrain split by land use (WorldCover), one mesh per region and class, coloured by z0 on the fixed Davenport scale. Inside Radius the ground is read by the RESOLVED table (built = the street between the meshed buildings, 0.03 m; tree = forest floor under a fetched crown, 0.1 m), beyond it by the upstream one. Wire with Roughness Lengths and Land Cover into Ground Roughness.</item>
