                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Crown density class (sets the Darcy-Forchheimer coefficients): Coarse, Medium or Dense — or a species from the shared vegetation library (same LAD and foliage Cd the Outdoor+ Vegetation Region and LBM engines use for that label, so one pick models the same tree in every engine). Wired text still works — the class keywords, a species label, or custom B and A coefficient triples on two lines. A wired LAI wins over the class.</item>
